import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 752 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter | Law-Encoding of New-Cosmos Matter","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 752 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter | Law-Encoding of New-Cosmos Matter","no":752,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter","Law-Encoding","New Cosmos","Matter Design","Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm"],"related":["15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","80-Plane Theory and Classification","76-First Ascension Milestone"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0752_模块4-超多元级物质-新宇宙法则编码.md","filePath":"en/0752_模块4-超多元级物质-新宇宙法则编码.md"}'),s={name:"en/0752_模块4-超多元级物质-新宇宙法则编码.md"};function o(r,e,l,c,d,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-752-hyper-multiverse-grade-matter-law-encoding-of-new-cosmos-matter" tabindex="-1">Entry 752 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter | Law-Encoding of New-Cosmos Matter <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-752-hyper-multiverse-grade-matter-law-encoding-of-new-cosmos-matter" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 752 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter | Law-Encoding of New-Cosmos Matter&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 15, 80, 76</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-designing-physical-laws-on-a-blank-sheet" tabindex="-1">Introduction: designing physical laws on a blank sheet <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-designing-physical-laws-on-a-blank-sheet" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: designing physical laws on a blank sheet&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The previous overview discussed law-weaving&#39;s basic principles. This entry goes into concrete operation: when a Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivator sets out to open a new cosmos (or new plane), how does he, from zero, design a whole matter system for this new cosmos? This is not &quot;moving over&quot; the old cosmos&#39;s matter, but <strong>encoding entirely new matter rules at the law layer</strong> — like designing physical laws on a blank sheet.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are encoding&#39;s coordinate system: the anti-predation axiom requires the new cosmos&#39;s matter system serve increment; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the new cosmos&#39;s matter be friendly to migrating Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires the new cosmos&#39;s matter system serve uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires causal isolation between new and old cosmos; the law-first axiom requires encoded laws be self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-new-cosmos-matter-encoding-s-five-parameter-layers" tabindex="-1">I. The New-Cosmos Matter Encoding&#39;s Five Parameter Layers <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-new-cosmos-matter-encoding-s-five-parameter-layers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The New-Cosmos Matter Encoding&#39;s Five Parameter Layers&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Designing a matter system for a new cosmos requires encoding five parameter layers:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Parameter Layer</th><th>Content</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Basic Physics Layer</td><td>Light speed, gravitational constant, spatial dimensions, and other basic constants</td><td>Three or four dimensions? How fast is light?</td></tr><tr><td>Periodic-Element Layer</td><td>Matter&#39;s basic element types and properties</td><td>How many elements? How do elements react?</td></tr><tr><td>Energy-Conversion Layer</td><td>Energy-matter conversion rules</td><td>E=mc² or another formula?</td></tr><tr><td>Life-Adaptation Layer</td><td>The matter system&#39;s support for life forms</td><td>Carbon-based? Silicon-based? Energy beings?</td></tr><tr><td>Law-Interface Layer</td><td>The interface between matter and the cultivation system</td><td>How is spirit energy injected into matter? How are laws woven?</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The five layers, from &quot;hard physics&quot; to &quot;soft interface,&quot; form the new cosmos&#39;s complete matter code.</p><h2 id="ii-encoding-s-key-decision-points" tabindex="-1">II. Encoding&#39;s Key Decision Points <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-encoding-s-key-decision-points" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Encoding&#39;s Key Decision Points&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the encoding process, several key decision points directly determine the new cosmos&#39;s civilizational trajectory:</p><p><strong>Decision 1: Dimension choice</strong></p><ul><li>Three-dimensional space: suitable for carbon-based life, but physical complexity is limited;</li><li>Four-dimensional space: high physical complexity, but life forms must adapt to extra dimensions;</li><li>Mixed dimensions: material layer 3D, energy layer 4D, consciousness domain higher-dimensional — Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s standard scheme.</li></ul><p><strong>Decision 2: Energy-conversion rate</strong></p><ul><li>High conversion rate: high cultivation efficiency, but energy easily runs wild;</li><li>Low conversion rate: slow cultivation but stable;</li><li>Adjustable conversion rate: different regions have different rates — high in the Origin Acceleration Domain, low in the Quest Sediment Domain.</li></ul><p><strong>Decision 3: Matter abundance</strong></p><ul><li>Extremely abundant matter: Myriad Ranks easily survive, but lack evolutionary pressure;</li><li>Extremely scarce matter: high survival pressure, but easily breeds predation;</li><li>Moderate abundance + weaving supplementation: Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s standard scheme — natural matter is moderate, weave when insufficient.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-encoding-s-self-consistency-verification" tabindex="-1">III. Encoding&#39;s Self-Consistency Verification <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-encoding-s-self-consistency-verification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Encoding&#39;s Self-Consistency Verification&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After law encoding completes, it must pass strict self-consistency verification (the law-first axiom&#39;s direct requirement):</p><ul><li><strong>Physical consistency</strong>: are basic physical constants compatible? For example, do light speed and gravitational constant contradict?</li><li><strong>Chemical consistency</strong>: is the periodic table self-consistent? Do element reactions have dead loops?</li><li><strong>Life consistency</strong>: can the life-adaptation layer actually produce life, or is it only paper design?</li><li><strong>Cultivation consistency</strong>: is the cultivation system&#39;s law interface compatible with the matter system?</li><li><strong>Long-term stability</strong>: simulate after a billion years; is the matter system still stable, or will it spontaneously collapse?</li></ul><p>Verification is auto-completed by the Alaya Network; failure sends it back for re-encoding.</p><h2 id="iv-encoding-s-myriad-rank-participation" tabindex="-1">IV. Encoding&#39;s Myriad-Rank Participation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-encoding-s-myriad-rank-participation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Encoding&#39;s Myriad-Rank Participation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The new cosmos&#39;s matter encoding is not decided by some strong one on his own head. Per the republican axiom of Myriad Races:</p><ul><li>Representatives of races migrating to the new cosmos participate in encoding decisions;</li><li>The encoding scheme is publicized network-wide, accepting Myriad-Rank opinions;</li><li>Key parameters (dimensions, conversion rate, abundance) are decided by Myriad-Rank representative vote;</li><li>After encoding completes, regular reviews revise per actual usage feedback.</li></ul><p>This ensures the new cosmos&#39;s matter system is not &quot;whatever the strong one likes gets encoded,&quot; but &quot;whatever Myriad Ranks need gets encoded.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the new cosmos is encoded from zero, not copying the old cosmos&#39;s matter system, avoiding the old system&#39;s historical baggage</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the new cosmos&#39;s matter system embeds anti-predation design — energy-conversion rate is adjustable, preventing predators from accumulating at high speed</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s &quot;new world&quot; is designed by Gu Chensha alone; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s new-cosmos encoding is Myriad-Rank co-governed</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: encoding already considers the five lineages&#39; adaptation, not encoding first then making some lineage accommodate</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: encoding schemes, parameter choices, and verification reports are all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>New-cosmos matter&#39;s law-encoding is one of Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivators&#39; grandest engineering projects. It is not &quot;build a new planet,&quot; but &quot;write a new physics.&quot; Well encoded, Myriad Ranks flourish ten thousand years in the new cosmos; poorly encoded, the whole cosmos is broken from the physical ground up. This is the law-first axiom&#39;s weight in the engineering field.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/80-位面理论与分类.html">Entry 80 · Plane Theory and Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/76-首次升维里程碑.html">Entry 76 · First Ascension Milestone</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/78-跨位面探索纪元.html">Entry 78 · Cross-Plane Exploration Era</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const g=i(s,[["render",o]]);export{u as __pageData,g as default};
